export function modelForLesson(id,help=false){const map={'c-pointer-change':'pointer','c-pointer-declare':'declare','c-address':'declare','c-dereference':'dereference','c-array-start':'array','c-pointer':'array','c-array':'array','c-array-pointer':'array','c-sizeof':'sizeof','c-types':'sizeof','c-function-start':'function','c-function':'function','c-doubleptr':'declare','c-pointerconst':'pointer'};return help?(map[id]?'help-'+map[id]:null):(stepModels[id]?id:null);}
export function playerMarkup(modelId,key=modelId,{predict=true,startStep=0}={}){const model=stepModels[modelId];if(!model)return '';return `<section class="step-player" data-player="${E(modelId)}" data-player-key="${E(key)}" data-predict="${predict}" data-start-step="${startStep}" data-step="0" tabindex="0" aria-label="${E(model.title)}单步推演"><header class="player-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">TRACE / 单步推演</span><h3>${E(model.title)}</h3></div><span class="player-count">第 0 步</span></header><p class="player-note">${E(model.note)}</p>${modelId==='c-pointer-change'?'<label class="experiment-picker">小实验：<select data-player-variant aria-label="选择两条语句的执行顺序"><option value="c-pointer-change">先换目标，再写内容</option><option value="c-pointer-change-alt">先写内容，再换目标</option></select></label>':''}<div class="player-grid"><div class="player-code" aria-label="完整代码与当前执行行"></div><div class="player-memory"><div class="player-memory-label">MEMORY / 地址与内容</div><div class="player-svg"></div></div></div><div class="player-narration" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div><div class="player-watch"></div><div class="player-prediction" hidden></div><footer class="player-controls"><button class="btn ghost" data-player-action="prev">← 上一步</button><button class="btn primary" data-player-action="next">下一步 →</button><button class="btn ghost" data-player-action="reset">重置</button><span class="player-key-hint">聚焦后用 ← / → 单步执行</span></footer></section>`;}
const sessions=new Map();
function positions(model,columns=3){const unique=new Map();for(const f of model.frames)for(const c of f.cells)if(!unique.has(c.id))unique.set(c.id,c);const cells=[...unique.values()];return cells.map((c,i)=>({...c,x:28+(i%columns)*190,y:30+Math.floor(i/columns)*150}));}
function scaffold(root,model){root.querySelector('.player-heading h3').textContent=model.title;root.querySelector('.player-note').textContent=model.note;root.querySelector('.player-code').innerHTML=model.code.map((line,i)=>`<div class="player-line" data-line="${i}"><span aria-hidden="true">${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><code>${E(line)}</code><b aria-hidden="true">执行</b></div>`).join('');const columns=root.querySelector('.player-memory').clientWidth<500?2:3;root.dataset.columns=columns;const cells=positions(model,columns),height=Math.max(210,Math.ceil(cells.length/columns)*150+30),uid='arrow-'+root.dataset.playerKey.replace(/[^a-z0-9-]/gi,'');const links=new Set(model.frames.flatMap(f=>f.links.map(([a])=>a)));root.querySelector('.player-svg').innerHTML=`<svg viewBox="0 0 ${columns===2?400:590} ${height}" role="img" aria-label="内存状态"><defs><marker id="${uid}" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L8 4 L0 8" class="player-arrow-tip"/></marker></defs>${[...links].map(pair=>`<path class="player-arrow" data-link="${pair}" marker-end="url(#${uid})"/>`).join('')}${cells.map(c=>`<g class="player-cell" data-cell="${c.id}" transform="translate(${c.x} ${c.y})"><rect width="160" height="104" rx="1"/><text x="12" y="24" class="memory-name"></text><text x="12" y="46" class="memory-address"></text><text x="12" y="75" class="memory-value"></text><text x="12" y="95" class="memory-detail"></text><text x="144" y="23" text-anchor="end" class="memory-changed">改</text></g>`).join('')}</svg>`;}
function update(root,session){const model=stepModels[session.model],f=model.frames[session.step];root.dataset.step=String(session.step);root.querySelector('.player-count').textContent=`第 ${session.step} / ${model.frames.length-1} 步`;root.querySelectorAll('.player-line').forEach(el=>{const active=Number(el.dataset.line)===f.line;el.classList.toggle('executing',active);if(active)el.setAttribute('aria-current','step');else el.removeAttribute('aria-current');});const pos=new Map(positions(model,Number(root.dataset.columns)||2).map(c=>[c.id,c]));root.querySelectorAll('[data-cell]').forEach(el=>{const c=f.cells.find(c=>c.id===el.dataset.cell);el.style.visibility=!c||c.hidden?'hidden':'visible';if(!c)return;el.classList.toggle('changed',f.changed.includes(c.id));el.classList.toggle('pointer-cell',!!c.pointer);el.querySelector('.memory-name').textContent=c.label;el.querySelector('.memory-address').textContent='位置 '+c.address;const old=el.querySelector('.memory-value').textContent;el.querySelector('.memory-value').textContent='值 '+c.value;el.querySelector('.memory-detail').textContent=c.detail||(c.pointer?'里面保存目标地址':'里面保存数据');if(old!==el.querySelector('.memory-value').textContent&&session.motion&&f.changed.includes(c.id)&&!globalThis.matchMedia?.('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches)el.animate?.([{opacity:.45},{opacity:1}],{duration:380,easing:'ease-out'});});root.querySelectorAll('[data-link]').forEach(el=>{const a=el.dataset.link,pair=f.links.find(pair=>pair[0]===a),b=pair?.[1],active=!!pair;el.style.opacity=active?'1':'0';if(!active)return;const from=pos.get(a),to=pos.get(b),sameRow=from.y===to.y;let d;if(sameRow){const direction=to.x>from.x?1:-1,x1=from.x+(direction>0?160:0),x2=to.x+(direction>0?-5:165);d=`M${x1} ${from.y+65} C${x1} ${from.y+130} ${x2} ${to.y+130} ${x2} ${to.y+65}`;}else d=`M${from.x+80} ${from.y} C${from.x+80} ${from.y-35} ${to.x+80} ${to.y+150} ${to.x+80} ${to.y+110}`;el.style.d=`path('${d}')`;});root.querySelector('svg').setAttribute('aria-label',f.cells.filter(c=>!c.hidden).map(c=>`${c.label}，位置${c.address}，值${c.value}`).join('；'));root.querySelector('.player-narration').innerHTML=`<strong>${E(f.title)}</strong><p>${E(f.why)}</p>`;root.querySelector('.player-watch').innerHTML=f.watch.map(([k,v])=>`<span><b>${E(k)}</b> ${E(v)}</span>`).join('');root.querySelector('[data-player-action=prev]').disabled=session.step===0;root.querySelector('[data-player-action=next]').disabled=session.step===model.frames.length-1;root.querySelector('.player-prediction').hidden=true;session.motion=false;}
export function mountPlayers(container,{onRecord=()=>{},onHelp=()=>{}}={}){if(!container?.querySelectorAll)return;container.querySelectorAll('.step-player').forEach(root=>{const key=root.dataset.playerKey;let s=sessions.get(key);if(!s){s={model:root.dataset.player,step:Math.max(0,Math.min(stepModels[root.dataset.player].frames.length-1,Number(root.dataset.startStep)||0)),predictions:{},motion:false};sessions.set(key,s);}scaffold(root,stepModels[s.model]);const variant=root.querySelector('[data-player-variant]');if(variant)variant.value=s.model;update(root,s);const move=delta=>{const model=stepModels[s.model],next=Math.max(0,Math.min(model.frames.length-1,s.step+delta));const pred=model.frames[next]?.prediction;if(delta>0&&root.dataset.predict==='true'&&pred&&!Object.hasOwn(s.predictions,next)){const box=root.querySelector('.player-prediction');box.hidden=false;box.innerHTML=`<strong>先预测，再执行</strong><p>${E(pred.prompt)}</p><div>${pred.options.map((v,i)=>`<button class="btn ghost" data-player-answer="${i}" data-next="${next}">${E(v)}</button>`).join('')}<button class="btn link" data-player-answer="skip" data-next="${next}">暂不预测，直接观察</button></div>`;box.querySelector('button')?.focus();return;}s.step=next;s.motion=true;update(root,s);if(!root.contains(document.activeElement))root.focus();if(next===model.frames.length-1)onRecord(key,{viewed:true});};root.addEventListener('click',event=>{const t=event.target.closest('[data-player-action],[data-player-answer]');if(!t||!root.contains(t))return;if(t.dataset.playerAnswer!==undefined){const next=Number(t.dataset.next),pred=stepModels[s.model].frames[next].prediction,choice=t.dataset.playerAnswer==='skip'?null:Number(t.dataset.playerAnswer);s.predictions[next]={choice,correct:choice===pred.answer};onRecord(key,{prediction:{step:next,...s.predictions[next]}});move(1);const note=document.createElement('p');note.className='prediction-feedback';note.textContent=choice===null?'已跳过预测。'+pred.why:choice===pred.answer?'预测正确。'+pred.why:'这次预测与执行结果不同。'+pred.why;root.querySelector('.player-narration').append(note);const nextButton=root.querySelector('[data-player-action=next]');(nextButton.disabled?root.querySelector('[data-player-action=prev]'):nextButton)?.focus();return;}if(t.dataset.playerAction==='reset'){s.step=0;s.predictions={};update(root,s);}else move(t.dataset.playerAction==='next'?1:-1);});root.addEventListener('keydown',event=>{if(event.target.matches('select,input,textarea')||event.target.closest('.player-prediction:not([hidden])'))return;if(event.key==='ArrowRight'||event.key==='ArrowLeft'){event.preventDefault();move(event.key==='ArrowRight'?1:-1);}});variant?.addEventListener('change',()=>{s.model=variant.value;s.step=0;s.predictions={};scaffold(root,stepModels[s.model]);update(root,s);onHelp(key);});});}
